00:52:21,176 --> 00:52:27,176
Trespass is a 2011 American crime thriller film directed by Joel
Schumacher, from a screenplay by Karl Gajdusek.

11
00:57:35,294 --> 00:57:41,294
It stars Nicolas Cage and Nicole Kidman as a married
couple taken hostage by extortionists.

12
01:02:49,411 --> 01:02:55,411
It also stars Ben Mendelsohn, Cam Gigandet, Liana Liberato, Jordana
Spiro, Dash Mihok, Emily Meade and Nico Tortorella.

13
01:08:03,529 --> 01:08:09,529
It had its world premiere at the Toronto International
Film Festival on September 14, 2011.

14
01:13:17,647 --> 01:13:23,647
